---
/**
 * Experience v6 S7 — the only motion script (budget: 2 KB source, guarded).
 * Baseline is the final state: nothing is hidden or animated until this runs,
 * and only when the visitor allows motion. It toggles one attribute:
 *   html[data-motion="on"]      -> lets the hero mark draw (CSS-only otherwise)
 * The below-the-fold "reveal plane" branch was removed (2026-10-12): the proof
 * band was its only target and no rendered page carries one any more.
 */
---

<script>
  if (!matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches) {
    document.documentElement.dataset.motion = "on";
  }
</script>
